(301, 40, 'Priyanshu Garg', 'Auto Generate Letters', 'Deployment', 'Hoisting ', 'Today, I checked a website that wasn\'t working. I updated it with the latest hosting changes, then updated the database and got the website up and running. After that, I requested the code from Astha and Nousheen, reviewed it, and found that it wasn’t correct. I’ve asked them to update it again. After that, I took care of some personal tasks. That’s all for today.', '0', '0', 510, 0, '2024-08-30', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0),
