(3713, 40, 'Priyanshu Garg', 'DOAGuru', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Hello Sir,\nThe website work is 90% complete. I have made the demo live, and you can check it now.\n\nHome Page\n\nCatalog Page\n\nCollections have been set\n\nProducts have been added and uploaded with details\n\nFeedback and Review section has been added\n\nProduct sharing option is also added\n\nOffer timer has been added\n\nCart option is working\n\nGuest user feature has been enabled – users can now place orders without logging in\n\nPayment gateway has been added (currently in test mode)\n\nShiprocket integration is done – orders are now syncing\n\nSubscribe option is added\n\n“Don’t Miss Out” deal section has been added where users can enter their name, mobile number, and email\n\nWebsite pages have been added\n\nIn the footer: Contact info, Quick Links, Menu Links, and Logo are added\n\nSocial media icon links are also added\n\nI’ve also completed some other tasks on my own. You can visit the website and check everything once.\nIf you have any updates or suggestions, please let me know so I can make the necessary changes.', '', '', 540, 0, '2025-05-24', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
