(11567, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'DOAGURU', 'Deployment', 'Deployment ', 'I went for lunch after the meeting and come after 20 mins. At 3:00pm\n\nThen i ask Priyanshu sir about the project file but he is o  call with the client. Then after that he gave me files.\n\nI got the project files from TL AT 4:01pm and the SQL database file at 4:22pm and then a probelm occurs which i told you the cross platform depency , the project is not working in my mac and it took about 1 hr or more to resolve it.\n\nToday i basically went through went through the whole voice command flow in our project  AI audio Doctor. Like from the starting when user clicks mic and speaks till the point where data get filled and saved. I tried to understand everything step by step how its actually working behind.\n', '0', '0', 480, 0, '2026-02-17', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
