(11805, 72, 'Atul Nema', 'DOAGuru', 'Digital Marketing', 'SEO', '**Doon International School — Today\'s SEO Work**\n\n---\n\n**1. Directory Submissions (10)**\nSubmitted the school\'s details to 10 online directories. This builds citations across the web and tells Google the business is real and consistent.\n\n**2. Business Submissions (5)**\nListed the school on 5 business platforms. More consistent listings = stronger local map pack presence.\n\n**3. Blog Updated (1)**\nPublished one blog on the website. Targets keyword traffic and keeps the site active with fresh content.\n\n**4. GMB Photos and Videos Updated**\nAdded new photos and videos to the Google Business Profile. Result — the profile is now appearing in these searches:\n\n| Query | Searches |\n|---|---|\n| doon international school | 233 |\n| doon international school jabalpur (nagpur road) | 159 |\n| international school jabalpur | 23 |\n| boarding school in jabalpur | 20 |\n| doon international school jabalpur | 16 |\n| cbse schools in jabalpur | <15 |\n| doon international school jabalpur vacancy | <15 |\n\n**5. GSC Optimisation**\nReviewed and optimised based on live search data. The site was at zero clicks before. This week\'s numbers:\n\n| Query | Clicks |\n|---|---|\n| doon international school jabalpur | 130 |\n| doon international school | 11 |\n| doon school jabalpur | 10 |\n| doon public school jabalpur | 5 |\n| doon international school jabalpur fees | 4 |\n| doon international school jabalpur vacancy | 3 |\n| best cbse school in jabalpur | 1 |\n\n---\n\n**Bottom Line**\n\nEvery query above was at zero before this work started. The site is now getting consistent traffic and showing up for both branded and category searches.\n\n1 BLOG IN DOA , 1 BLOG IN JAN JAYOTI \nGMB WORK DOON ', '0', '0', 480, 0, '2026-03-11', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
