(12008, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'new poroject', 'Development', 'FrontEnd ', '1. Discount Feature Enhancement\nIntroduced a discount amount option in addition to the existing percentage-based discount.\nImplemented validation logic to ensure that the maximum discount amount cannot exceed the predefined percentage limit.\nExample:\nIf the maximum discount is set to 30%\nFor a quotation of ?10,000, the maximum allowable discount will be ?3,000\nUsers cannot enter a discount amount greater than ?3,000\nThe same validation logic has been successfully applied to both Quotation and Invoice modules.\n2. Print Button Update\nUpdated the functionality of the Print button for both Invoices and Quotations.\nNow, when the Print button is clicked, the document opens in a new browser tab instead of the same window.\nThis improves usability and prevents loss of the current working page.\n3. Thumbnail Option Fix (Graphic Services)\nResolved an issue where the \"Thumbnail Creation\" option was not visible under Graphic Design services.\nImplemented a fix so that the option now automatically appears as \"YES\" by default whenever a Graphic service is selected.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-03-24', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
