(12056, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'Natura', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Today, I worked on multiple improvements and optimizations across the project. Below are the key tasks completed:\n1. Image Optimization\nReplaced all existing JPG images with WebP format across the entire project.\nThis change improves website performance by reducing image size and enhancing load speed.\n2. Backend Integration for Products\nPreviously, products were being managed from frontend utilities.\nImplemented a new backend API route to handle product data (fetching and storing).\nCreated a structured flow where product data is now fully managed via the backend.\n3. File Upload System (Images & PDFs)\nIntegrated Multer for handling file uploads.\nUploaded images and product PDFs to ImageKit.\nStored the returned ImageKit URLs in the database for efficient access and management.\n4. Database Update\nDesigned and created a new products table in the database.\nThis table stores product details along with their associated ImageKit URLs.\n5. Admin Product Upload Feature\nDeveloped a feature allowing admin users to upload products directly from the frontend.\nThis removes dependency on manual or static product handling.\n6. Infinite Scroll Implementation\nImplemented infinite scrolling on the products page to handle large datasets efficiently.\nProducts now load dynamically as the user scrolls, improving performance and user experience.\n7. UI/UX Improvements\nEnhanced the products page UI:\nImplemented a sticky search field that stays fixed at the top during scrolling.\nThis allows users to search without needing to scroll back to the top repeatedly.', '0', '0', 540, 0, '2026-03-31', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
