(12257, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'Natura', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Task Report – [Today’s Work]\n1. Contact Form Notification System (Backend Feature Development)\nImplemented a new feature in the Natura website for handling contact form submissions.\nAdded backend logic to:\nCheck for the existence of a Super Admin (only one allowed).\nIdentify Admins with “Live” status (multiple allowed, activated by Super Admin).\nConfigured the system so that:\nWhenever a user submits the contact form, an email notification is automatically sent to:\nThe Super Admin, and/or\nAny Admin marked as Live.\nEnsured role-based control and validation for admin activation.\n2. Product Image Storage Optimization (Backend + Server Changes)\nModified the image upload mechanism:\nPreviously, product images were uploaded to an external image kit service.\nNow, images are stored directly in the server upload folder.\nUpdated backend APIs and storage handling accordingly.\nPerformed significant changes in:\nDatabase structure (to support new image paths/storage system)\nServer configuration (to handle local file storage efficiently)\n3. System Improvements & Refactoring\nApplied multiple backend and server-level updates to support the new features.\nImproved overall system reliability and control over data handling.', '0', '0', 480, 0, '2026-04-11', 'In Progress', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
