(12290, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'Natura', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '## ???? Daily Task Report (15 April)\n\nToday’s work focused on improving the **Admin Panel’s security, functionality, and user experience**. A complete **Forgot Password system** was implemented, allowing admins to reset their password using OTP verification in a secure step-by-step flow. The frontend was successfully integrated with backend APIs, enabling smooth OTP sending, verification, and password reset functionality.\n\nThe **Login and Register pages UI** was upgraded to a more modern and clean design with improved user experience. Issues related to **Navbar and Footer** (such as logo visibility and styling problems) were fixed to ensure consistent layout across all pages.\n\nOn the backend, **security was strengthened** by implementing OTP-based authentication, hashing passwords, and moving sensitive data to environment variables. Additionally, **project cleanup** was performed by removing unnecessary compiled files and optimizing the codebase.\n\n### ???? Key Points:\n\n* Implemented OTP-based Forgot Password system\n* Completed frontend-backend API integration\n* Enhanced Login/Register UI\n* Fixed Navbar & Footer issues\n* Improved backend security (.env, password hashing)\n* Cleaned and optimized codebase\n\n???? Overall, the system is now more secure, clean, and user-friendly.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-04-15', 'In Progress', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
