(12297, 72, 'Atul Nema', 'DOAGuru', 'Digital Marketing', 'SEO', 'Daily Work Update – 16 April 2026\nDoon International School – SEO & GMB\nContent & SEO Execution\n1 Blog Created & Published\n“Is Your Child Ready for Boarding School? Signs Parents Should Look For”\nDesigned to target high-intent parent searches related to boarding school admissions\nSuccessfully submitted for indexing via Google Search Console\nWebsite Performance (Latest Insights)\nTotal Clicks: 498 (+17% growth)\nTotal Impressions: 7.05K (+40% growth)\nAverage CTR: 6.2%\nAverage Position: 5.3\n\nHighlight:\n\nHomepage generated 460 clicks, showing strong brand visibility and search demand\nGoogle Business Profile (GMB) Activities\n1 Post Published (Admissions-focused)\n1 Image Uploaded\n1 Video Uploaded\nGMB Performance (April 2026)\nTotal Interactions: 320\nCalls Generated: 76\nChat Clicks: 21\nDirection Requests: 177\nWebsite Clicks: 46\n\nInsight:\n\nHigh direction requests indicate strong local interest and visit intent\nCalls and interactions reflect active parent engagement\nAdditional Work Across Projects\nContent Development\n1 Blog Completed – DOAGuru Infosystems\nFocused on digital marketing / software solutions for business growth\n1 Blog Completed – Jan Jyoti Super Speciality Eye Hospital\nMedical-focused, SEO-optimized content targeting patient awareness\n2 Blogs Completed – IVF Project\nDesigned for fertility awareness, patient education, and lead generation\nClient Meeting & Strategy\nConducted a detailed meeting with Ayushi Construction\nDiscussed website development roadmap\nPlanned SEO optimization strategy\nIdentified structure for improving online presence and lead generation\nOverall Work Summary (Today)\nTotal Blogs Created: 5\nGMB Activities Completed: 3 (Post + Image + Video)\nClient Strategy Meetings: 1\nSEO Performance: Strong growth in visibility and engagement\nFinal Positioning\n\nToday’s execution focused on:\n\nStrengthening search visibility across multiple projects\nExpanding content ecosystem for long-term SEO growth\nEnhancing local engagement and lead signals via GMB\nBuilding new client pipeline through strategy planning\n\nAll activities are aligned toward scaling traffic, improving engagement, and driving measurable business outcomes.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-04-16', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
(12298, 84, 'Aditya Dubey', 'DOAGuru', 'Other', 'Other ', '25 backlinks submissions  (12 directory submissions for Jabalpur IVF fertility centre   on high-quality platforms. These submissions will help improve website visibility, build backlinks, and support overall SEO performance.13 PDF submissions for jan jyoti hospital on the blog \"Retinal Detachment: Warning Signs You Must Never Ignore\", 1 post on Doaguru GMB , 1 post on Jyotirmay IVF & Fertility Centre: Dr. Gunjan Goswami,1video added on life medicity hospital GMB , 5 review reply for goswami xray and pathology , 3 Jyotirmay IVF & Fertility Centre, jan jyoti review reply , jabalpur ivf centre review reply , Doaguru review reply .', '0', '0', 480, 0, '2026-04-16', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
(12299, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'FrontEnd ', '1. Global Refactoring and Architecture\n\nCentralizing API Environment Variables (cd41fde)\n\nRemoved hardcoded backend URLs such as localhost from the codebase.\nIntroduced a centralized configuration using .env variables (VITE_API_BASE_URL).\nUpdated the apiBaseUrl.js file accordingly.\nImproved scalability and simplified production deployment.\nChanges impacted approximately 60 files across both Business Developer and Admin modules.\n2. Admin and Business Developer Module Parity\n\nSynchronizing Core Services (ecc9c1a)\n\nRedesigned BD panels (AddService, BDInvoice) to align with Admin panels (ServicesLanding, AdminInvoice).\nAdded the missing DiscountSetting.jsx page.\nIntegrated proper routing via /BD/discount-setting in BDRouter.\nLarge-scale update affecting over 4000 lines of code.\nNo changes were made to backend API contracts.\n\nMirroring UI Updates Across BD Screens (05c2c90)\n\nSynced UI updates across BD modules including BdExplorePlans, ClientDetails, InvoiceCalculation, and SeoServices.\nFixed incorrect navigation links where BD routes were pointing to /admin/... instead of /BD/....\n3. UI Enhancements and Bug Fixes\n\nQuotation Page Layout Changes (9a18dae)\n\nImproved layout and structure for the Create Quotation page.\nUpdated components: Quotation.jsx and ServicesLanding.jsx.\n\nAction Dropdown Behavior Fix (8c709c8)\n\nResolved issue where action dropdown menus remained open after interaction.\nImplemented useRef and useEffect to detect outside clicks and close the dropdown automatically.\nApplied fix in History.jsx and InvoiceHistory.jsx.\n\nInvoice Signature Realignment (7021633)\n\nAdjusted UI to position the invoice signature section on the right side in AdminInvoice.jsx.\nImproved visual consistency of the invoice layout.\nSummary\nFocused on improving code maintainability and scalability through centralized configuration.\nAchieved near-complete parity between Admin and Business Developer modules.\nDelivered multiple UI improvements and resolved key usability issues.', '0', '0', 540, 0, '2026-04-16', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
